TF17E78EC Version 3.0
T543FE4C1 Welcome to my Gran Turismo-inspired showroom!
T0C8C6481 This project had been in plans and worked on for the past 3 years. I hope you enjoyed all the hard work I've poured into making this!
TCD7ADAFE All the available controls are displayed in the footer at the bottom of the screen, please check it out if you're confused on which button does what.
T6EB910BF You can highlight a setting to view its description in the footer, this applies to all the setting boxes!
